#: src/lib/products.ts
msgid "Working with campaigns"
msgstr "Working with campaigns"

#: src/lib/products.ts
msgid "Most campaigns run on a patchwork of spreadsheets and goodwill. 80a brings the kind of technology and analysis that usually only the biggest operations can afford to smaller, faster-moving teams, and stays close enough to the work to change things when the campaign changes."
msgstr "Most campaigns run on a patchwork of spreadsheets and goodwill. 80a brings the kind of technology and analysis that usually only the biggest operations can afford to smaller, faster-moving teams, and stays close enough to the work to change things when the campaign changes."

#: src/lib/products.ts
msgid "Volunteer and field tools"
msgstr "Volunteer and field tools"

#: src/lib/products.ts
msgid "Action hubs, rosters and polling-day tools that give supporters a clear next step and give organisers a clear picture."
msgstr "Action hubs, rosters and polling-day tools that give supporters a clear next step and give organisers a clear picture."

#: src/lib/products.ts
msgid "Phone research"
msgstr "Phone research"

#: src/lib/products.ts
msgid "Fast, affordable surveys of real voters through Voiceblocks, our AI-native phone research platform."
msgstr "Fast, affordable surveys of real voters through Voiceblocks, our AI-native phone research platform."

#: src/lib/products.ts
msgid "Electorate analysis"
msgstr "Electorate analysis"

#: src/lib/products.ts
msgid "Seat-level modelling, demographics and results analysis, written up so the people making decisions can use it."
msgstr "Seat-level modelling, demographics and results analysis, written up so the people making decisions can use it."

#: src/lib/products.ts
msgid "Hands-on support"
msgstr "Hands-on support"

#: src/lib/products.ts
msgid "We set things up with you, train your team and stay on call through the campaign."
msgstr "We set things up with you, train your team and stay on call through the campaign."

#: src/lib/products.ts
msgid "Volunteer action hub"
msgstr "Volunteer action hub"

#: src/lib/products.ts
msgid "A self-organising volunteer hub that gives every supporter a useful next step."
msgstr "A self-organising volunteer hub that gives every supporter a useful next step."

#: src/lib/products.ts
msgid "Your campaign’s central volunteer action hub."
msgstr "Your campaign’s central volunteer action hub."

#: src/lib/products.ts
msgid "Victoria, Australia"
msgstr "Victoria, Australia"

#: src/lib/products.ts
msgid "Candidates and campaign teams, starting with the 2026 Victorian state election"
msgstr "Candidates and campaign teams, starting with the 2026 Victorian state election"

#: src/lib/products.ts
msgid "Live"
msgstr "Live"

#: src/lib/products.ts
msgid "Campaigns are good at getting people to say “I want to help” and much worse at what happens next. Actionblocks gives every campaign a branded hub where supporters can see exactly what they can do, whether that is an hour of door-knocking, a shift in the office, or ten minutes online from the couch."
msgstr "Campaigns are good at getting people to say “I want to help” and much worse at what happens next. Actionblocks gives every campaign a branded hub where supporters can see exactly what they can do, whether that is an hour of door-knocking, a shift in the office, or ten minutes online from the couch."

#: src/lib/products.ts
msgid "Each action is a short guided flow. Supporters earn points as they go, and bigger responsibilities unlock over time, such as writing letters to the editor, running a street stall or leading a team. Organisers see who did what and get a heads-up when someone puts their hand up."
msgstr "Each action is a short guided flow. Supporters earn points as they go, and bigger responsibilities unlock over time, such as writing letters to the editor, running a street stall or leading a team. Organisers see who did what and get a heads-up when someone puts their hand up."

#: src/lib/products.ts
msgid "One place to help"
msgstr "One place to help"

#: src/lib/products.ts
msgid "Every way to get involved, online and in person, on a single board in the campaign’s own branding."
msgstr "Every way to get involved, online and in person, on a single board in the campaign’s own branding."

#: src/lib/products.ts
msgid "Guided actions"
msgstr "Guided actions"

#: src/lib/products.ts
msgid "A library of ready-made actions, from following the campaign on social media to checking enrolment and signing up to volunteer."
msgstr "A library of ready-made actions, from following the campaign on social media to checking enrolment and signing up to volunteer."

#: src/lib/products.ts
msgid "Momentum built in"
msgstr "Momentum built in"

#: src/lib/products.ts
msgid "Points, progress and reminders turn a first sign-up into a habit, with new actions added as the campaign moves."
msgstr "Points, progress and reminders turn a first sign-up into a habit, with new actions added as the campaign moves."

#: src/lib/products.ts
msgid "Set up with you"
msgstr "Set up with you"

#: src/lib/products.ts
msgid "A 30-minute call, then we build your hub with your branding, links and starter actions. You edit and share."
msgstr "A 30-minute call, then we build your hub with your branding, links and starter actions. You edit and share."

#: src/lib/products.ts
msgid "AI-native phone research"
msgstr "AI-native phone research"

#: src/lib/products.ts
msgid "Phone surveys conducted by an AI interviewer, with every answer traceable to a transcript."
msgstr "Phone surveys conducted by an AI interviewer, with every answer traceable to a transcript."

#: src/lib/products.ts
msgid "AI-native phone research for your team."
msgstr "AI-native phone research for your team."

#: src/lib/products.ts
msgid "Campaigns, advocacy groups and researchers"
msgstr "Campaigns, advocacy groups and researchers"

#: src/lib/products.ts
msgid "Invitation only"
msgstr "Invitation only"

#: src/lib/products.ts
msgid "Voiceblocks runs phone surveys by having a conversation. You write a short questionnaire, upload a list, and an AI interviewer calls people, asks the questions naturally, follows up when an answer is unclear and records the whole call."
msgstr "Voiceblocks runs phone surveys by having a conversation. You write a short questionnaire, upload a list, and an AI interviewer calls people, asks the questions naturally, follows up when an answer is unclear and records the whole call."

#: src/lib/products.ts
msgid "Every completed interview is kept as a full transcript, and answers are pulled out of the conversation and linked back to what was actually said. Results can be weighted to the population you care about, and you can ask questions of the data in plain English."
msgstr "Every completed interview is kept as a full transcript, and answers are pulled out of the conversation and linked back to what was actually said. Results can be weighted to the population you care about, and you can ask questions of the data in plain English."

#: src/lib/products.ts
msgid "Write it like a conversation"
msgstr "Write it like a conversation"

#: src/lib/products.ts
msgid "Build a questionnaire in minutes, reorder questions, and try it on your own phone before anyone else is called."
msgstr "Build a questionnaire in minutes, reorder questions, and try it on your own phone before anyone else is called."

#: src/lib/products.ts
msgid "Quotas, budgets and limits"
msgstr "Quotas, budgets and limits"

#: src/lib/products.ts
msgid "Set calling hours, attempt limits, demographic targets and a spending cap, and let the campaign stop itself when it is done."
msgstr "Set calling hours, attempt limits, demographic targets and a spending cap, and let the campaign stop itself when it is done."

#: src/lib/products.ts
msgid "Answers you can check"
msgstr "Answers you can check"

#: src/lib/products.ts
msgid "Every response links to the transcript it came from, so nobody has to take the numbers on trust."
msgstr "Every response links to the transcript it came from, so nobody has to take the numbers on trust."

#: src/lib/products.ts
msgid "Ask your data"
msgstr "Ask your data"

#: src/lib/products.ts
msgid "Weighted results, cross-tabs and an analyst you can question in plain English, grounded in the real responses."
msgstr "Weighted results, cross-tabs and an analyst you can question in plain English, grounded in the real responses."

#: src/lib/products.ts
msgid "Organising software"
msgstr "Organising software"

#: src/lib/products.ts
msgid "Organising software for distributed communities, built WhatsApp-first and mobile-first."
msgstr "Organising software for distributed communities, built WhatsApp-first and mobile-first."

#: src/lib/products.ts
msgid "Software for a new generation of organizing."
msgstr "Software for a new generation of organizing."

#: src/lib/products.ts
msgid "Worldwide, with a focus on the Global South"
msgstr "Worldwide, with a focus on the Global South"

#: src/lib/products.ts
msgid "Grassroots groups, community networks and international NGOs"
msgstr "Grassroots groups, community networks and international NGOs"

#: src/lib/products.ts
msgid "Live, free for grassroots groups"
msgstr "Live, free for grassroots groups"

#: src/lib/products.ts
msgid "Belcoda is organising software for large, distributed communities: networks of people who are connected, active and pulling in the same direction without waiting for instructions from the top."
msgstr "Belcoda is organising software for large, distributed communities: networks of people who are connected, active and pulling in the same direction without waiting for instructions from the top."

#: src/lib/products.ts
msgid "It is built for the way most of the world actually organises, which is on a phone, on WhatsApp, often on a slow connection. People, groups, messaging and events live in one place, and the whole thing works in any language and on any device. It is free for grassroots organisations, and Belcoda is stewarded by a non-profit foundation, Stichting Belcoda."
msgstr "It is built for the way most of the world actually organises, which is on a phone, on WhatsApp, often on a slow connection. People, groups, messaging and events live in one place, and the whole thing works in any language and on any device. It is free for grassroots organisations, and Belcoda is stewarded by a non-profit foundation, Stichting Belcoda."

#: src/lib/products.ts
msgid "WhatsApp-first"
msgstr "WhatsApp-first"

#: src/lib/products.ts
msgid "Messaging, sign-ups and actions that happen where people already are, including group chats and QR codes."
msgstr "Messaging, sign-ups and actions that happen where people already are, including group chats and QR codes."

#: src/lib/products.ts
msgid "Community and events"
msgstr "Community and events"

#: src/lib/products.ts
msgid "Manage people and groups, then organise, recruit for and run events across the whole network."
msgstr "Manage people and groups, then organise, recruit for and run events across the whole network."

#: src/lib/products.ts
msgid "Fast everywhere"
msgstr "Fast everywhere"

#: src/lib/products.ts
msgid "Designed to feel instant on cheap phones and poor connections. Some organisations run entirely from mobile."
msgstr "Designed to feel instant on cheap phones and poor connections. Some organisations run entirely from mobile."

#: src/lib/products.ts
msgid "Open to your stack"
msgstr "Open to your stack"

#: src/lib/products.ts
msgid "An API, webhooks and an SDK so Belcoda can sit in front of the systems you already use."
msgstr "An API, webhooks and an SDK so Belcoda can sit in front of the systems you already use."

